1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,870
Hamburgers, egg pancakes, sizzling noodles

2
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:05,873
Rice balls, toast, and savory soy milk

3
00:00:05,873 --> 00:00:09,209
There are so many delicious breakfasts
around the world

4
00:00:09,209 --> 00:00:13,480
I'm going to collect them all in my
breakfast truck

5
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,081
And so,

6
00:00:14,081 --> 00:00:16,149
Beelu, who loves breakfast,

7
00:00:16,149 --> 00:00:18,685
set off on an adventure to collect

8
00:00:18,685 --> 00:00:20,354
all kinds of breakfast!

9
00:00:55,722 --> 00:00:58,392
That was fun!

10
00:00:59,860 --> 00:01:02,062
Let's find breakfast!

11
00:01:02,062 --> 00:01:04,865
Good morning, Beelu! Good morning, kids!

12
00:01:04,865 --> 00:01:07,801
Today's breakfast is a hamburger

13
00:01:07,801 --> 00:01:09,803
In the adventure story coming up,

14
00:01:09,803 --> 00:01:12,339
there will be three hamburger stickers

15
00:01:12,339 --> 00:01:13,807
Help Beelu

16
00:01:13,807 --> 00:01:16,076
find where they are!

17
00:01:16,076 --> 00:01:18,478
Let's collect today's breakfast!

18
00:01:23,750 --> 00:01:26,687
What's for breakfast today?

19
00:01:36,897 --> 00:01:38,498
Are you okay?

20
00:01:39,166 --> 00:01:41,568
Help me!

21
00:01:45,973 --> 00:01:48,308
Stay calm. I have to stay calm

22
00:01:49,643 --> 00:01:51,378
I'm Beelu

23
00:01:51,378 --> 00:01:54,114
What just happened?

24
00:01:55,515 --> 00:01:58,251
Thank you. I'm Ostrich Bro

25
00:02:00,587 --> 00:02:03,457
I'm the owner of a hamburger breakfast
shop

26
00:02:05,792 --> 00:02:07,127
Every morning,

27
00:02:07,127 --> 00:02:08,261
I go to the neighboring town

28
00:02:08,261 --> 00:02:10,931
to buy freshly baked, delicious hamburger
buns

29
00:02:11,732 --> 00:02:13,333
Then I come back to my shop

30
00:02:13,333 --> 00:02:15,669
and make the most delicious hamburgers

31
00:02:18,005 --> 00:02:20,407
But when it rains,

32
00:02:20,407 --> 00:02:24,678
I run into hamburger-bun bandits

33
00:02:24,678 --> 00:02:26,947
Hamburger-bun bandits?

34
00:02:26,947 --> 00:02:28,348
That's right

35
00:02:28,348 --> 00:02:31,551
When it rains, our city floods

36
00:02:31,551 --> 00:02:34,621
and the carp in the ponds swim out

37
00:02:34,621 --> 00:02:38,025
They love delicious hamburger buns

38
00:02:39,559 --> 00:02:42,896
I used to avoid them by walking on stilts

39
00:02:43,897 --> 00:02:45,032
You can't see me!

40
00:02:45,032 --> 00:02:48,635
But even that trick doesn't work anymore

41
00:02:52,839 --> 00:02:54,641
Don't wobble! Don't wobble!

42
00:03:11,725 --> 00:03:12,726
I never expected

43
00:03:12,726 --> 00:03:15,729
them to get so strong

44
00:03:15,729 --> 00:03:18,331
To steal my delicious hamburger buns,

45
00:03:18,331 --> 00:03:20,600
they must have trained for a long time

46
00:03:22,536 --> 00:03:25,072
If this keeps happening whenever it rains,

47
00:03:25,072 --> 00:03:28,008
my breakfast shop won't be able to open

48
00:03:28,942 --> 00:03:31,278
Does it flood here often?

49
00:03:31,278 --> 00:03:32,279
That's right

50
00:03:32,279 --> 00:03:35,148
The people who live here are used to it

51
00:03:46,626 --> 00:03:47,294
Shoot!

52
00:03:48,829 --> 00:03:51,164
What should I do?

53
00:03:51,164 --> 00:03:53,567
Stay calm. I have to stay calm

54
00:03:53,567 --> 00:03:56,236
Ostrich Bro, let us help you

55
00:03:57,237 --> 00:03:58,839
Your hamburger shop

56
00:03:58,839 --> 00:04:00,974
will be open as usual today

57
00:04:05,178 --> 00:04:06,780
The breakfast truck is so fast

58
00:04:06,780 --> 00:04:08,715
The carp won't be able to catch us

59
00:04:08,715 --> 00:04:09,716
Great!

60
00:04:09,716 --> 00:04:12,119
Let's speed all the way back to the shop

61
00:04:14,254 --> 00:04:18,191
(Do you really think you can handle my
muscles?)

62
00:04:21,928 --> 00:04:24,464
(Guys, get them!)

63
00:04:25,065 --> 00:04:26,399
Don't hit my face! Don't hit my face!

64
00:04:27,601 --> 00:04:29,669
Protect the hamburger buns!

65
00:04:39,479 --> 00:04:41,948
Stay calm. I have to stay calm

66
00:04:43,283 --> 00:04:45,552
What should I do?

67
00:04:45,552 --> 00:04:46,820
Maybe I should just quit

68
00:04:46,820 --> 00:04:48,755
But I still have rent and insurance to pay

69
00:04:48,755 --> 00:04:50,423
And I need to save for retirement

70
00:04:50,423 --> 00:04:51,558
But... but...

71
00:04:51,558 --> 00:04:53,026
Maybe I should just work for a big company

72
00:04:53,026 --> 00:04:55,162
Let's do the Breakfast Brain Workout

73
00:04:55,162 --> 00:04:57,898
and think of a way to help Ostrich Bro!

74
00:04:57,898 --> 00:04:59,833
I can't calm down!

75
00:05:00,767 --> 00:05:04,237
Circle your left hand, circle your right hand

76
00:05:04,237 --> 00:05:06,506
Clap! Clap!

77
00:05:06,506 --> 00:05:08,175
Jump up!

78
00:05:08,175 --> 00:05:11,711
Move your left brain, move your right
brain

79
00:05:11,711 --> 00:05:14,181
Clap! Clap!

80
00:05:14,181 --> 00:05:16,449
Bi Ru Akokay

81
00:05:19,653 --> 00:05:22,055
Beelu, will this really work?

82
00:05:22,055 --> 00:05:24,391
We'll find out if we try

83
00:05:24,391 --> 00:05:26,326
Three, two—

84
00:05:26,593 --> 00:05:28,195
Fly!

85
00:05:29,796 --> 00:05:32,666
Let's fly straight into the breakfast shop!

86
00:05:35,402 --> 00:05:36,469
Great!

87
00:05:36,469 --> 00:05:38,471
They're too high up for the carp to reach

88
00:05:39,539 --> 00:05:40,740
(Use that move!)

89
00:05:40,740 --> 00:05:41,875
(That's the plan!)

90
00:06:00,894 --> 00:06:02,762
How did this happen?

91
00:06:05,765 --> 00:06:07,901
Stay calm. I have to stay calm

92
00:06:09,502 --> 00:06:12,372
Ah! I can't stay calm!

93
00:06:12,372 --> 00:06:13,573
There's only one box of hamburger buns
left

94
00:06:13,573 --> 00:06:15,575
What should we do?

95
00:06:16,910 --> 00:06:20,247
Ostrich Bro, let's do the Breakfast Brain
Workout again

96
00:06:20,247 --> 00:06:21,781
and think of a good idea!

97
00:06:22,515 --> 00:06:24,317
The Breakfast Brain Workout?

98
00:06:24,317 --> 00:06:26,119
Didn't we just do it?

99
00:06:26,119 --> 00:06:29,322
This time, everyone has to dance together

100
00:06:47,674 --> 00:06:49,409
It's Brain Workout Time!

101
00:06:49,409 --> 00:06:53,079
Circle your left hand, circle your right hand

102
00:06:53,079 --> 00:06:54,814
Clap! Clap!

103
00:06:54,814 --> 00:06:56,683
Jump up!

104
00:06:56,683 --> 00:07:00,553
Move your left brain, move your right
brain

105
00:07:00,553 --> 00:07:02,155
Clap! Clap!

106
00:07:02,155 --> 00:07:02,489
Jump up!

107
00:07:02,489 --> 00:07:04,157
Jump up!

108
00:07:04,157 --> 00:07:07,827
Make a sun with your hands and say good
morning

109
00:07:07,827 --> 00:07:10,163
Clap! Clap!

110
00:07:10,163 --> 00:07:12,432
Bi Ru Akokay

111
00:07:14,968 --> 00:07:18,305
Ostrich Bro, I've got a super-great idea!

112
00:07:25,245 --> 00:07:27,447
Ostrich Bro, are you okay?

113
00:07:28,448 --> 00:07:29,316
I can do it

114
00:07:36,589 --> 00:07:38,325
Beelu, I'm ready

115
00:07:42,529 --> 00:07:45,665
Since the carp come out and cause trouble
when it floods,

116
00:07:45,665 --> 00:07:48,134
all we have to do is drain the water!

117
00:08:25,105 --> 00:08:28,041
Yeah! We did it!

118
00:08:48,395 --> 00:08:50,063
Thank you, Beelu

119
00:08:50,063 --> 00:08:52,465
These delicious hamburgers are on me

120
00:08:52,465 --> 00:08:56,002
Wow, they look delicious!

121
00:08:58,204 --> 00:09:00,473
They're so good!

122
00:09:00,473 --> 00:09:03,076
Wow, they smell great!

123
00:09:03,543 --> 00:09:05,211
Hey, handsome! Hey, beautiful!

124
00:09:05,211 --> 00:09:07,347
Would you like a delicious hamburger?

125
00:09:07,347 --> 00:09:08,548
I want one! I want one!

126
00:09:11,684 --> 00:09:13,753
That was fun!

127
00:09:21,294 --> 00:09:23,029
Let's find breakfast!

128
00:09:23,029 --> 00:09:24,831
Here are the answers!

129
00:09:24,831 --> 00:09:27,700
Today's breakfast stickers are in these
places

130
00:09:31,504 --> 00:09:32,906
Did you find them?

131
00:09:35,975 --> 00:09:38,378
Yeah, I knew it!

132
00:09:39,712 --> 00:09:42,849
How do you make a delicious hamburger?

133
00:09:42,849 --> 00:09:45,852
First, slap the hamburger patty back and forth between your hands

134
00:09:45,852 --> 00:09:49,122
This squeezes the air out of the meat

135
00:09:49,122 --> 00:09:50,590
Next, coat it in flour

136
00:09:51,791 --> 00:09:53,059
Dip it in egg

137
00:09:54,327 --> 00:09:55,662
Coat it in flour again

138
00:09:57,997 --> 00:09:59,599
Fry it in oil

139
00:10:00,733 --> 00:10:02,202
While it cooks,

140
00:10:02,202 --> 00:10:05,004
toast the hamburger bun until crisp

141
00:10:05,004 --> 00:10:07,207
Then fry an egg

142
00:10:07,207 --> 00:10:10,076
Finally, stack all the ingredients
together

143
00:10:13,346 --> 00:10:16,349
And a delicious hamburger is ready!

144
00:10:16,349 --> 00:10:19,152
Wow, it looks delicious!

145
00:10:25,959 --> 00:10:27,560
Beelu, take a guess

146
00:10:27,560 --> 00:10:30,096
When hamburgers were first invented,

147
00:10:30,096 --> 00:10:33,433
what kind of workers especially liked
them?

148
00:10:33,433 --> 00:10:35,902
Oh, who?

149
00:10:35,902 --> 00:10:39,105
The answer is factory workers

150
00:10:40,173 --> 00:10:41,574
After the Industrial Revolution,

151
00:10:41,574 --> 00:10:44,711
workers became very busy

152
00:10:44,711 --> 00:10:46,112
From morning until night,

153
00:10:46,112 --> 00:10:48,982
they had to work in factories

154
00:10:48,982 --> 00:10:50,383
They were so busy they didn't even have
time

155
00:10:50,383 --> 00:10:53,386
to sit down and enjoy a proper meal

156
00:10:54,454 --> 00:10:55,588
It was exhausting!

157
00:10:56,656 --> 00:10:57,790
At that time,

158
00:10:57,790 --> 00:11:00,326
a clever merchant brought a food cart

159
00:11:00,326 --> 00:11:01,728
and started selling hamburgers

160
00:11:01,728 --> 00:11:03,930
They became popular with many workers

161
00:11:03,930 --> 00:11:08,601
Huh? There are so many kinds of food in
the world

162
00:11:08,601 --> 00:11:12,138
Why did hamburgers become so popular?

163
00:11:12,138 --> 00:11:13,206
That's because...

164
00:11:13,206 --> 00:11:16,142
Busy workers often had to eat standing up

165
00:11:16,142 --> 00:11:19,479
or take their meals back to the factory

166
00:11:19,479 --> 00:11:22,482
And food like hamburgers, tucked inside a
bun,

167
00:11:22,482 --> 00:11:23,950
that you can hold in both hands

168
00:11:23,950 --> 00:11:26,753
and even eat while walking,

169
00:11:26,753 --> 00:11:29,556
naturally became popular

170
00:11:29,556 --> 00:11:33,092
Hamburgers were a lifesaver for busy
workers

171
00:11:33,092 --> 00:11:35,628
Oh, I see!

172
00:11:38,965 --> 00:11:39,899
Ostrich Bro,

173
00:11:39,899 --> 00:11:41,834
your hamburgers are so delicious

174
00:11:41,834 --> 00:11:43,770
You're a lifesaver for me too!

175
00:11:43,770 --> 00:11:46,105
Thank you, Beelu!
